<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f8fc">
  <meta name="description" content="Turn your social content calendar into clean client proofs. Share one review link, collect feedback, and track approvals without the spreadsheet-to-PDF shuffle.">
  <title>PostProof — Social posts, ready for client review</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #202139;
      --muted: #686b83;
      --soft: #f7f8fc;
      --line: #e9eaf2;
      --purple: #6549e8;
      --purple-dark: #5035d0;
      --purple-light: #eeeaff;
      --mint: #dff7eb;
      --mint-ink: #22764e;
      --coral: #ff896f;
      --white: #fff;
      --shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(39, 37, 85, .12);
      --radius: 22px;
      --max: 1160px;
    }
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--white);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.55;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
    button, a { -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
    .skip-link { position: absolute; left: -9999px; top: 8px; z-index: 50; padding: 12px 16px; background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; }
    .skip-link:focus { left: 12px; }
    .container { width: min(var(--max), calc(100% - 48px)); margin-inline: auto; }
    .announcement { background: #292847; color: #fff; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; padding: 9px 18px; letter-spacing: .01em; }
    .announcement strong { color: #cfc5ff; font-weight: 700; }
    header { position: relative; z-index: 10; background: rgba(255,255,255,.94); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(233,234,242,.8); }
    .nav { min-height: 76px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 26px; }
    .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 800; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -.045em; white-space: nowrap; }
    .brand-mark { width: 34px; height: 34px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--purple); color: #fff; border-radius: 11px; box-shadow: 0 7px 18px rgba(101,73,232,.24); }
    .brand-mark svg { width: 19px; height: 19px; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 30px; margin-left: auto; }
    .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; color: #5b5d73; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--purple); }
    .nav-cta, .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 9px; min-height: 46px; padding: 0 19px; border: 0; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--purple); color: #fff; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 9px 21px rgba(101,73,232,.19); transition: transform .18s ease, background .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease; cursor: pointer; }
    .nav-cta:hover, .button:hover { background: var(--purple-dark); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(101,73,232,.25); }
    .button-secondary { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid #dedfec; box-shadow: none; }
    .button-secondary:hover { background: #f8f7ff; color: var(--purple); border-color: #cfc7ff; box-shadow: none; }
    .menu-toggle { display: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; background: white; color: var(--ink); padding: 9px 11px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }

    .hero { overflow: hidden; position: relative; padding: 76px 0 82px; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 76% 34%, rgba(232,226,255,.85), transparent 33%), linear-gradient(180deg, #faf9ff 0%, #fff 92%); }
    .hero::before { content: ""; position: absolute; width: 390px; height: 390px; right: -170px; top: -165px; border: 1px solid rgba(101,73,232,.11); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 40px rgba(101,73,232,.025), 0 0 0 80px rgba(101,73,232,.02); }
    .hero-grid { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .9fr) minmax(490px, 1.1fr); align-items: center; gap: 50px; }
    .eyebrow { display: inline-flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; padding: 7px 11px; color: #5138c9; background: #eeeaff; border-radius: 99px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .045em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .eyebrow-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #755be9; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(117,91,233,.12); }
    h1 { max-width: 560px; margin: 20px 0 18px; font-size: clamp(43px, 5.2vw, 66px); line-height: 1.03; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
    .hero-copy { max-width: 510px; margin: 0; color: #62647b; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; }
    .arrow { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1; }
    .micro-note { margin: 15px 0 0; color: #77798c; font-size: 12px; }
    .micro-note strong { color: #56586d; }
    .hero-art { position: relative; min-height: 460px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .glow { position: absolute; width: 84%; height: 78%; border-radius: 50%; background: #ebe5ff; filter: blur(47px); opacity: .75; }
    .app-window { position: relative; width: min(100%, 620px); border: 1px solid #e5e4ef; border-radius: 19px; background: #fff; box-shadow: var(--shadow); transform: rotate(-1deg); overflow: hidden; }
    .window-top { height: 45px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 0 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eff0f5; background: #fcfcfe; }
    .window-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #dddfe9; }
    .window-title { margin-left: 9px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #73758a; }
    .preview-wrap { padding: 22px; background: linear-gradient(140deg,#f9f8ff,#f5f9ff); }
    .proof-toolbar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .proof-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .proof-sub { margin-top: 3px; color: #85879a; font-size: 10px; }
    .review-tag { border-radius: 99px; background: #fff5de; color: #986a0d; padding: 6px 9px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; }
    .proof-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr; gap: 17px; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #e9e8f0; background: #fff; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 7px 20px rgba(32,33,57,.045); }
    .social-art { position: relative; min-height: 193px; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; background: linear-gradient(145deg,#f5c7b9 0%,#f7d8c5 38%,#c2d6c4 100%); }
    .social-art::before { content: ""; position: absolute; width: 132px; height: 132px; border-radius: 50%; background: #e9a78e; right: 20px; top: 29px; box-shadow: -39px 55px 0 -10px #fff4dc; }
    .social-art::after { content: "SLOW\A MORNINGS"; white-space: pre; position: absolute; left: 17px; bottom: 16px; color: #343747; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: .02em; }
    .sun { position: absolute; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: #f5d66e; left: 42px; top: 28px; }
    .plant { position: absolute; right: 34px; bottom: 0; width: 3px; height: 80px; background: #5a7860; transform: rotate(13deg); }
    .post-details { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; }
    .post-channel { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 10px; color: #797b8e; font-weight: 700; }
    .channel-icon { width: 19px; height: 19px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 6px; background: #fce9f0; color: #cc3f72; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 900; }
    .caption { margin: 12px 0 11px; color: #55576d; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.65; }
    .hash { color: #735de0; }
    .details-bottom { margin-top: auto; border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f5; padding-top: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 9px; color: #898b9d; }
    .avatar-stack { display: flex; align-items: center; }
    .avatar { width: 22px; height: 22px; margin-left: -5px; border: 2px solid #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: #f2c9a9; color: #694b39; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 800; }
    .avatar:first-child { margin-left: 0; background: #c5d8c8; }
    .avatar:last-child { background: #dbd4f9; }
    .comment { margin-top: 11px; padding: 10px 11px; border-radius: 9px; background: #f7f6ff; color: #696b80; font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .comment b { display: block; margin-bottom: 3px; color: #403d62; font-size: 9px; }
    .approve-row { display: flex; gap: 7px; margin-top: 10px; }
    .approve-btn, .revise-btn { flex: 1; padding: 7px 5px; border-radius: 7px; text-align: center; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; }
    .approve-btn { background: #e3f7ec; color: #287650; }
    .revise-btn { background: #f4f4f8; color: #6f7184; }
    .floating-note { position: absolute; z-index: 2; right: -4px; bottom: 42px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 15px; border-radius: 13px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(42,39,80,.13); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; transform: rotate(2deg); }
    .check-circle { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--mint); color: var(--mint-ink); font-weight: 900; }

    .section { padding: 94px 0; }
    .section-soft { background: var(--soft); }
    .section-heading { max-width: 660px; margin: 0 auto 48px; text-align: center; }
    .section-kicker { margin-bottom: 11px; color: var(--purple); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .11em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 46px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
    .section-heading p { margin: 15px auto 0; max-width: 570px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; }
    .problem-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
    .problem-card { padding: 25px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 17px; background: #fff; }
    .icon-box { width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 13px; background: var(--purple-light); color: var(--purple); }
    .icon-box svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }
    .problem-card h3 { margin: 18px 0 8px; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
    .problem-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }

    .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 18px; counter-reset: step; }
    .step { position: relative; padding: 24px 20px; border-radius: 17px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: white; counter-increment: step; }
    .step-number { width: 33px; height: 33px; display: grid; place-items: center; margin-bottom: 19px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f0edff; color: var(--purple); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 850; }
    .step h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 16px; }
    .step p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .step:not(:last-child)::after { content: "→"; position: absolute; top: 30px; right: -17px; z-index: 2; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 50%; background: white; color: #9995bb; font-weight: 800; }

    .fit-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 44px; align-items: center; }
    .fit-copy h2 { max-width: 470px; }
    .fit-copy > p { max-width: 500px; margin: 17px 0 22px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; }
    .fit-list { display: grid; gap: 13px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .fit-list li { display: flex; gap: 11px; align-items: flex-start; color: #494b61; font-size: 14px; }
    .fit-list svg { flex: 0 0 19px; width: 19px; height: 19px; margin-top: 2px; color: #38a775; }
    .fit-panel { padding: 28px; border: 1px solid #e8e5fb; border-radius: 21px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#f4f1ff,#fff 80%); }
    .fit-panel-label { color: #77748d; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 850; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; }
    .fit-panel h3 { margin: 9px 0 18px; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    .workflow-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 36px 1fr auto; gap: 12px; align-items: center; padding: 13px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e9e6f7; }
    .workflow-icon { width: 34px; height: 34px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 10px; background: #fff; color: #6b54df; font-weight: 800; }
    .workflow-row b { display: block; font-size: 12px; }
    .workflow-row small { color: #85869a; font-size: 10px; }
    .pill { padding: 5px 8px; border-radius: 99px; background: #e3f7ec; color: #287650; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; }
    .pill.pending { background: #fff2d8; color: #9b6d12; }

    .pricing-section { background: #f8f7ff; }
    .pricing-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 360px)); justify-content: center; gap: 20px; }
    .price-card { position: relative; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #e5e4ed; border-radius: 19px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(39,37,85,.045); }
    .price-card.featured { border: 2px solid var(--purple); box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(101,73,232,.13); }
    .popular { position: absolute; top: -13px; right: 21px; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--purple); color: #fff; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .plan-name { margin: 0; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 850; }
    .plan-description { min-height: 42px; margin: 7px 0 19px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .price { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
    .price strong { font-size: 43px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
    .price span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .billing-note { margin-bottom: 20px; color: #85869a; font-size: 11px; }
    .price-card .button { width: 100%; }
    .features-label { margin: 24px 0 12px; color: #73758a; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 850; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .09em; }
    .plan-features { display: grid; gap: 11px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .plan-features li { display: flex; gap: 9px; align-items: flex-start; color: #55576d; font-size: 12px; }
    .plan-features svg { flex: 0 0 16px; width: 16px; height: 16px; color: #45a879; }
    .pricing-footnote { margin: 26px auto 0; max-width: 670px; color: #77798e; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }

    .faq-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr; gap: 50px; align-items: start; }
    .faq-intro p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; }
    .faq-items { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
    details { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 13px; background: #fff; padding: 0 17px; }
    summary { position: relative; padding: 17px 25px 17px 0; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750; list-style: none; }
    summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    summary::after { content: "+"; position: absolute; right: 0; top: 13px; color: var(--purple); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; }
    details[open] summary::after { content: "−"; }
    details p { margin: 0 0 17px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }

    .final-cta { padding: 74px 0; }
    .cta-box { position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 54px 30px; border-radius: 24px; background: #2d2a4e; color: #fff; text-align: center; }
    .cta-box::before, .cta-box::after { content: ""; position: absolute; width: 240px; height: 240px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-radius: 50%; }
    .cta-box::before { left: -85px; top: -135px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 28px rgba(255,255,255,.025),0 0 0 56px rgba(255,255,255,.02); }
    .cta-box::after { right: -110px; bottom: -170px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 28px rgba(255,255,255,.025),0 0 0 56px rgba(255,255,255,.02); }
    .cta-box h2 { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: clamp(31px,4vw,43px); }
    .cta-box p { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 510px; margin: 14px auto 23px; color: #d1d0e0; font-size: 15px; }
    .cta-box .button { position: relative; z-index: 1; color: #2d2a4e; background: #fff; box-shadow: none; }
    .cta-box .button:hover { background: #efedff; }
    footer { padding: 27px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: #77798d; font-size: 12px; }
    .footer-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 19px; }
    .footer-links a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--purple); }
    :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #a89af8; outline-offset: 3px; }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 25px; }
      .hero-copy, h1 { max-width: 700px; }
      .hero-art { min-height: 430px; }
      .app-window { max-width: 650px; }
      .floating-note { right: max(10px, calc((100% - 650px)/2)); }
      .fit-grid { gap: 30px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .container { width: min(100% - 34px, var(--max)); }
      .announcement { font-size: 11px; }
      .nav { min-height: 66px; }
      .menu-toggle { display: inline-flex; }
      .nav-cta { display: none; }
      .nav-links { display: none; position: absolute; top: 65px; left: 0; right: 0; padding: 14px 20px 19px; background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); box-shadow: 0 12px 22px rgba(32,33,57,.07); }
      .nav-links.open { display: grid; gap: 0; }
      .nav-links a { padding: 12px 3px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f1f5; }
      .nav-links a:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
      .hero { padding: 54px 0 55px; }
      .hero-grid { gap: 18px; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 11vw, 58px); }
      .hero-copy { font-size: 16px; }
      .hero-art { min-height: auto; padding: 22px 0 30px; }
      .app-window { transform: none; }
      .preview-wrap { padding: 14px; }
      .proof-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .social-art { min-height: 190px; }
      .post-details { min-height: 145px; }
      .floating-note { bottom: 8px; right: 0; }
      .section { padding: 68px 0; }
      .section-heading { margin-bottom: 32px; }
      .problem-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .problem-card { padding: 22px; }
      .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
      .step { padding: 18px 15px; }
      .step:not(:last-child)::after { display: none; }
      .fit-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 29px; }
      .pricing-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 430px; margin-inline: auto; gap: 22px; }
      .faq-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; }
      .cta-box { padding: 44px 20px; }
      .footer-inner { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 420px) {
      .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; }
      .hero-actions .button { width: 100%; }
      .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .proof-toolbar { align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
      .workflow-row { grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr; }
      .workflow-row .pill { grid-column: 2; justify-self: start; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
      *, *::before, *::after { transition-duration: .01ms !important; animation-duration: .01ms !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <div class="announcement"><strong>Early access</strong> · A simpler client-review step for your social content workflow</div>
  <header>
    <nav class="nav container" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="PostProof home">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19.5 6.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span>postproof</span>
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links" id="nav-links">
        <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
        <a href="#who-its-for">Who it's for</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      </div>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="#pricing">See beta plans <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <button class="menu-toggle" id="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-links">Menu</button>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero" id="top">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Client approvals, minus the chaos</span>
          <h1>Get social posts approved without the file shuffle.</h1>
          <p class="hero-copy">Turn your content calendar into clean, shareable post proofs. Clients can approve or request changes in one place, and you can see what’s still waiting.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button" href="#pricing">Explore beta plans <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a class="button button-secondary" href="#how-it-works">See how it works</a>
          </div>
          <p class="micro-note"><strong>No social account connection.</strong> No auto-publishing. Just a clearer review step.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration of a sample social post proof with client feedback and approval status">
          <div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="app-window">
            <div class="window-top"><span class="window-dot"></span><span class="window-dot"></span><span class="window-dot"></span><span class="window-title">PostProof · Spring campaign review</span></div>
            <div class="preview-wrap">
              <div class="proof-toolbar">
                <div><div class="proof-title">Spring content · Week 2</div><div class="proof-sub">4 posts · Updated just now</div></div>
                <span class="review-tag">Awaiting review</span>
